      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels so heavy lately. i keep thinking about how much effort it takes just to exist every single day. if there’s no inherent point to any of this, it feels like we're just stuck in this loop of performing tasks and feeling pain for no reason. it doesn't even feel like living anymore, just... maintaining a cycle.",
